The original project provides the Burp Suite Montoya extension, the embedded
ktor server, the io.modelcontextprotocol Kotlin SDK MCP transport (SSE + stdio
proxy), the Claude Desktop installer, and the original MCP tool set.

Modifications in this repository (additional MCP tools for scanning, site map,
scope, sniper fuzzing, BCheck import, proxy match-and-replace, header injection,
and extra codecs) are also released under GPLv3, as required by the upstream
license. All upstream copyright notices are retained.

